# GALLERY SHOTLIST (shooting plan, shotlist), written 2026-11-19 at writeShotlist, scenarios written the same day, none played yet.
# THE STORY, "Market day": three Kija from the hill village (guests validated by the owner 2026-11-19, "ok pour 3 Kija": anonymous, kind Colonist_Kija,
# xenotype Kija, created by the scenario, removed after each shot) walk down to Nelim's Sanctuary at dawn with a Milk crate (the thread: carried item).
# One day, Clear weather, 7h to 18h (one `I set the hour to N` per shot, rhythm +2 hours each). Opening and closing mirror each other on a walking line
# (arrive 7h, leave 18h). Protagonist Nelim (Human, no property changed). Guests: Fenn (woman, Female body), Bram (man, Male body drawn from Naked_Thin),
# Wisp (thin person, Thin body). Outfits kept all day: Nelim indigo Apparel_BasicShirt rgb (60, 70, 140) + Apparel_Pants (fixture trousers); Fenn VAE_Apparel_Tunic
# rgb (200, 150, 50) + VAE_Apparel_TribalKilt rgb (120, 60, 40); Bram Apparel_BasicShirt rgb (235, 228, 205) + Apparel_Pants + Apparel_Cape rgb (30, 120, 120);
# Wisp VAE_Apparel_Apron rgb (200, 110, 130) + VAE_Apparel_Shorts rgb (70, 110, 80). No hat (the ears are the subject). Hair: Nelim keeps her fixture hairstyle;
# the Kija guests have no separate hairstyle (Bald: the mane tuft is drawn by the Kija head). Everyone smiles (MouthLipsSimpleSmile, Nelim her own face step), no sweat
# (temperature 20 degrees). The mod adds no animal (rule 5 empty); one duck as life. Credits: Vanilla Apparel Expanded 1814987817, Mlie.StickLantern 2024351846 (Mlie,
# original Dalrae), Show Me Your Hands 2475965842 (Mlie), Show Me Your Tools 3774821567 (apparel and visual mods from Cat 2026-11-19). DepMap wsl-deps.gallery.map,
# seeds config/gallery. Size spread (2026-11-22 recompose after score-gallery REDO, guests were 10 px at 268 px): 6, 5, 5.5, 4.5, 5.5, 6, guests grouped within 6 cells; check all at 268 px (ears and tail).
# Cells are chosen from the frame centres of the places (no free-cell list exists for these places): the first run reads them, nothing is played yet.
#
#   1. kija-1-arrival | WIDE (opening) | water-garden centre 167 173, frame (165, 172) root size 6 | 7h Clear | +0
#        Subject: the guests arrive at dawn with goods. Fenn leads in profile (165, 171) facing East and walks on, Bram three-quarter front (163, 172) carrying Milk,
#        Wisp three-quarter back (161, 171) facing North, Nelim (169, 172) facing West forced to walk, paused mid-stride (instant: just before the greeting).
#        A Duck seen from the front at (165, 169). Decor: Plant_Daylily x5 fully grown
#        at (160, 174) (162, 175) (165, 175) (168, 175) (171, 174). Gesture: forced walks, 40 ticks, paused. Says: a new people walks in at dawn with goods.
#   2. kija-2-offer | MEDIUM | terrace centre 196 123, frame (196, 121) root size 5 | 9h Clear | +2 hours
#        Subject: Fenn offers the crate to Nelim. Fenn at (195, 121) facing East (arrives from (194, 121) by a forced walk) carrying Milk, Nelim at (197, 121) facing West, face to face in contact, EndTable between at
#        (196, 121). Decor: Stool x2 empty at (194, 124) (198, 124), Plant_Rose x2 at (193, 122) (197, 123), SculptureSmall at (196, 124), TorchLamp lit at (200, 121).
#        Instant: just before Nelim takes it; forced walk 1 cell, 20 ticks, paused. Says: a Kija woman trades with the colonist, ears, mane and spots read.
#   3. kija-3-rice | MEDIUM-WIDE | rice-paddies (229, 121), frame (229, 120) root size 5.5 | 11h Clear | +4 hours
#        Subject: Bram harvests the ripe rice. Bram back view at (228, 121) forced into the job Harvest on the plant at (229, 121), paused after 90 ticks (read the
#        first capture, 60 to 120); Show Me Your Tools draws the tool (unproven). Nelim in profile at (231, 120) carrying Milk. Decor: Plant_Rice fully grown at
#        (229, 121) (229, 122) (230, 121), Hay at (225, 118) (225, 119) (226, 118), Milk crate at (233, 118), Plant_Daylily x3 at (226, 123) (227, 123) (228, 123).
#        Fallback if the tool does not show: Bram walks the row with the crate. Says: the Kija are farmers.
#   4. kija-4-book | CLOSE (series close shot) | hut (141, 72), frame (141, 73) root size 4.5 | 12h Clear | +5 hours
#        Subject: Wisp takes a book from the shelf. Wisp three-quarter front at (141, 72) facing South carrying Novel (forced walk from (140, 72), 20 ticks, paused), just after taking it from the BookcaseSmall at
#        (141, 74). Decor: PlantPot_Bonsai at (143, 73), Stool at (139, 73), TorchLamp lit at (143, 71) (hut was dark). Nelim out of frame at (150, 66). Says: the thin Kija, head
#        and shoulders, ears and mane large in the frame.
#   5. kija-5-trade | MEDIUM | emerald-clearing (197, 152), frame (197, 152) root size 5.5 | 16h Clear | +9 hours
#        Subject: Bram hands the crate to Nelim. Bram profile at (196, 152) facing East carrying Milk, Nelim at (197, 152) facing West in contact, Fenn at (199, 151) facing West,
#        Wisp three-quarter back at (199, 154) facing North walking in (forced walk to (198, 153), 30 ticks, paused; instant: just after the hand-off). Decor: Brazier lit at
#        (197, 155), Plant_Daylily x6 fully grown at (193, 148) (196, 147) (199, 147) (202, 148) (193, 156) (202, 156). Says: the whole people and the three bodies in one scene.
#   6. kija-6-departure | MEDIUM-WIDE (closing) | statue-garden centre 155 99, frame (155, 101) root size 6 | 18h Clear | +11 hours
#        Subject: the guests leave without the crate, back views up the path, tails and ears in warm light. Fenn (154, 100), Bram (155, 101), Wisp (156, 100) facing North
#        and forced to walk, 30 ticks, paused; Nelim in profile at (151, 99) facing East watching. Decor: Plant_Rose x4 at (151, 102) (153, 104) (154, 104) (161, 103),
#        Plant_Daylily x4 at (150, 100) (152, 106) (158, 106) (160, 100), TorchLamp lit at (152, 103). Mirrors shot 1. Says: they leave at golden hour.
#   7. kija-7-genes | INTERFACE tab, no subtitle | terrace (196, 121), cropped from the 1920x1080 frame | 9h Clear
#        Genes tab of Fenn (the Kija genes): select Fenn alone, the game interface is shown, open the hidden Genes inspect tab (PiT 2026-11-19, compiled, not played with a Kija).
#        Guest steps: gender, xenotype Kija, then body type LAST; never `the other colonists are out of frame` with guests.
# Open points: face parts of the guests (MouthLipsSimpleSmile needs the face stack of the Sanctuary map with a Kija head), Bald with a Kija head, the cells above, the Duck
# kind at the pond, Milk placed as decor, ears and tail legible at 268 px. Novel and Milk are Core defs (BookDefs.xml, Core items).
